        "original_id": "d00f0c46-89c0-5622-9f6e-46e3fcbe49d4",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Cid Corman, Elswyth Thane\n- Roles: poet, translator, editor, romance novelist\n- Publications: Origin\n- Topics: American poetry\n\nFacts:\n- Cid Corman was born on June 29, 1924.\n- Elswyth Thane, born Helen Elswyth Thane Ricker Beebe, was born on May 16, 1900.\n- Elswyth Thane was an American romance novelist.\n- Cid Corman was an American poet, translator, and editor.\n- Cid Corman was most notable as the editor of \"Origin\".\n- Cid Corman was a key figure in the history of American poetry in the second half of the 20th century.\n- Elswyth Thane died on July 31, 1984.\n- Cid Corman died on March 12, 2004.",
